+        // KV lending: the cells the prompts in progress still need (this batch + what is left of every slot still in
+        // PROCESSING_PROMPT), sent every iteration, so a long prompt takes its rows back from the MoE expert cache in one
+        // take and a cancelled one stops holding them (0 here or on the all-idle return above).  A prompt that fits one
